---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { pathFor, repoUrl } from '../lib/catalog';

const components = pathFor('survey-assets/wam-components.webp');
const architectures = pathFor('survey-assets/wam-architectures.webp');
---

<div class="survey-introduction">
  <header class="survey-title-block">
    <p class="survey-kicker">PREDICT THE WORLD. CONNECT TO ACTION.</p>
    <h1>World-Action Models<span>for Robot Learning and Control: A Survey</span></h1>
    <p class="survey-subtitle">A robotics-oriented review of models that connect future world prediction<br class="desktop-break"/> with executable action generation.</p>
    <nav class="survey-links" aria-label="Survey resources">
      <a href="#library"><Icon name="book" size={17}/> Paper library</a>
      <a href={pathFor('map/?mode=quadrants')}><Icon name="grid" size={17}/> Research map</a>
      <a href={pathFor('reports/')}><Icon name="list" size={17}/> Reading reports</a>
      <a href={repoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><Icon name="github" size={17}/> GitHub</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="survey-section overview-section" aria-labelledby="overview-heading">
    <h2 id="overview-heading">Overview</h2>
    <figure class="survey-figure">
      <a class="figure-link" href={pathFor('survey-assets/wam-components.pdf')} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open the WAM component overview as a full-size PDF in a new tab">
        <img src={components} width="3000" height="1330" fetchpriority="high" alt="World-action model components: language and visual encoders feed a predictive backbone, which connects world prediction and action decoding to robot execution and optional closed-loop feedback."/>
      </a>
      <figcaption><span>From perception and language to world prediction and robot action.</span><a href={pathFor('survey-assets/wam-components.pdf')} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View full-size figure <Icon name="arrow" size={13}/></a></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="survey-prose">
      <p><strong>World-Action Models (WAMs)</strong> couple predictions of how the world will evolve with the actions a robot can execute. This survey examines how representations, dynamics, and action generation come together to support robot learning and control.</p>
      <p>We organize the field around model components, architecture design, training paradigms, and data. We also review applications in manipulation, navigation, and autonomous driving, alongside evaluation methods and open challenges.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="survey-section architecture-section" aria-labelledby="architecture-heading">
    <div class="architecture-heading">
      <h2 id="architecture-heading">Architecture at a glance</h2>
      <p>Two design choices, four families of world-action models.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="survey-figure">
      <a class="figure-link" href={pathFor('survey-assets/wam-architectures.pdf')} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open the four WAM architecture families as a full-size PDF in a new tab">
        <img src={architectures} width="3000" height="612" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Four world-action architecture families combine unified or dual-system designs with joint prediction or inverse dynamics, using shared backbones or separate video and action experts."/>
      </a>
      <figcaption><span>Unified or dual-system architectures × joint prediction or inverse dynamics.</span><a href={pathFor('survey-assets/wam-architectures.pdf')} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View full-size figure <Icon name="arrow" size={13}/></a></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <p class="architecture-description">Our architecture taxonomy connects these two axes to make different modeling choices easier to compare.</p>
    <a class="survey-map-link" href={pathFor('map/?mode=quadrants')}>Explore the four quadrants <Icon name="right" size={17}/></a>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .survey-introduction { background: #fff; color: #30363d; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .survey-title-block, .survey-section { width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 96px)); margin-inline: auto; }
  .survey-title-block { padding-block: 53px 39px; text-align: center; }
  .survey-kicker { margin: 0 0 19px; color: #64768a; font-size: calc(10px * var(--font-scale)); font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .16em; }
  h1 { margin: 0; color: #2f343b; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: clamp(35px, 4.1vw, calc(48px * var(--font-scale))); font-weight: 720; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.035em; text-wrap: balance; }
  h1 span { display: block; margin-top: 12px; font-size: .64em; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  .survey-subtitle { margin: 22px auto 0; color: #68717d; font-size: calc(14px * var(--font-scale)); line-height: 1.7; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .survey-links { display: flex; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 9px; margin-top: 25px; }
  .survey-links a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 41px; padding: 9px 17px; border: 1px solid #363d46; border-radius: 999px; background: #363d46; color: #fff; font-size: calc(11px * var(--font-scale)); font-weight: 550; line-height: 1.35; text-decoration: none; transition: background .15s ease; }
  .survey-links a:hover { background: #4d627a; border-color: #4d627a; }
  .survey-section h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: calc(25px * var(--font-scale)); font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: -.025em; line-height: 1.3; text-align: center; }
  .overview-section { padding-top: 10px; }
  .survey-figure { margin: 28px 0 0; }
  .figure-link { display: block; border-radius: 5px; cursor: zoom-in; }
  .survey-figure img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  figcaption { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px 24px; margin-top: 17px; color: #76808d; font-size: calc(10px * var(--font-scale)); line-height: 1.65; }
  figcaption a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; color: #526b83; text-decoration: none; }
  figcaption a:hover, .survey-map-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .survey-prose { max-width: 940px; margin: 29px auto 0; font-size: calc(14px * var(--font-scale)); line-height: 1.85; color: #555e6a; }
  .survey-prose p { margin: 0; }
  .survey-prose p + p { margin-top: 15px; }
  .survey-prose strong { color: #363e49; font-weight: 650; }
  .architecture-section { margin-top: 49px; padding-block: 38px 45px; border-top: 1px solid #e8ebee; text-align: center; }
  .architecture-heading p { margin: 12px 0 0; color: #717b87; font-size: calc(12px * var(--font-scale)); line-height: 1.65; }
  .architecture-section .survey-figure { margin-top: 31px; }
  .architecture-section figcaption { text-align: left; }
  .architecture-description { margin: 26px auto 0; color: #65717e; font-size: calc(12px * var(--font-scale)); line-height: 1.75; }
  .survey-map-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 15px; color: #405f7c; font-size: calc(12px * var(--font-scale)); font-weight: 650; text-decoration: none; }
  a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #5286ae; outline-offset: 5px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .survey-title-block, .survey-section { width: calc(100% - 40px); }
    .survey-title-block { padding-block: 35px 30px; }
    .survey-kicker { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .11em; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(30px, 6.5vw, 43px); }
    h1 span { max-width: 560px; margin-inline: auto; font-size: .64em; }
    .survey-subtitle { max-width: 540px; margin-top: 20px; font-size: calc(12px * var(--font-scale)); }
    .desktop-break { display: none; }
    .survey-links { gap: 8px; margin-top: 22px; }
    .survey-links a { min-height: 40px; padding: 9px 13px; font-size: calc(10px * var(--font-scale)); }
    .survey-section h2 { font-size: calc(22px * var(--font-scale)); }
    .survey-figure { margin-top: 23px; }
    figcaption { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 5px; margin-top: 13px; text-align: center; }
    .survey-prose { margin-top: 23px; font-size: calc(12px * var(--font-scale)); line-height: 1.85; }
    .architecture-section { margin-top: 31px; padding-block: 29px 33px; }
    .architecture-section figcaption { text-align: center; }
    .architecture-description { margin-top: 21px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .survey-links a { transition: none; } }
</style>
